. local txt "Notes: `rd1' `rd2'`vamove' Black dots = average of years 0 to +`whi' minus the year before (-1); gray squar
> es = the same years"

. local txt "`txt' minus the average of years `wlo' to -2. Firm and year effects; bars = 95% intervals (crossing 0 = not
>  clear); 'Years before': p"

. local txt "`txt' below 0.05 = already changing differently before (a warning sign). Acquisition = first year with 10%+
>  foreign-owned capital"

. local txt "`txt' after a year below 10% (a reported share, not a verified purchase; it stays an acquirer if the share 
> falls back: `n_back_c' of"

. local txt "`txt' `n_later_c'). Energy records in doubt left out (importers of unknown export status in `dtxt'). Value 
> added = output value minus"

